          <div class="rules-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">入席前 · 定规</span><h2>一局诗会，静候开章</h2><p>为「{{ selectedKeyword }}」选择一份适合今晚的诗会节奏。</p></div><div class="rule-jade"><small>令字</small><strong>{{ selectedKeyword }}</strong></div></div>
          <div class="difficulty-list"><button v-for="item in difficulties" :key="item.id" class="difficulty-row" :class="{ selected: difficulty === item.id }" @click="difficulty = item.id"><span class="difficulty-dot"></span><span><strong>{{ item.name }}</strong><small>{{ item.description }}</small></span><em>{{ item.time }}s / 回合</em><i>{{ difficulty === item.id ? '已选' : '选择' }}</i></button></div>
          <div class="rule-notes"><div><span>回合规则</span><strong>轮流接诗，句不重出</strong></div><div><span>胜负规则</span><strong>累计答对 5 句 · 先声夺人</strong></div><div><span>提示礼数</span><strong>每局最多 3 次，提示诗句入错题本</strong></div></div>
          <div class="view-actions"><button class="ink-button ghost" @click="stage = 'keywords'">返回</button><button class="ink-button primary" @click="enterGathering">{{ isOnlineMode ? '寻觅诗友' : '入席开局' }} <span>→</span></button></div>
